{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3021010020030","name":"雛菜","text":"────ね","trans":"────呐","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020050","name":"雛菜","text":"今寝てた～？","trans":"刚才在睡觉～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020070","name":"円香","text":"……\r\n……寝てたのかも","trans":"……\n……可能是在睡","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020080","name":"雛菜","text":"あは～\r\nプロデューサーから返事来た～！","trans":"啊哈～\n制作人回信了～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020090","name":"円香","text":"……え、誰","trans":"……诶，谁","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020100","name":"雛菜","text":"へ～？\r\n……プロデューサー！","trans":"诶～？\n……制作人啊！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020120","name":"円香","text":"まあ、誰でもいいけど\r\nなんの連絡？","trans":"算了，谁都无所谓\n是什么联络？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020130","name":"雛菜","text":"そっちにも来てない～？","trans":"你那边没收到吗～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-23","name":"チェイン","text":"『今日は遅れても大丈夫』","trans":"“今天就算迟了也没关系”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-24","name":"チェイン","text":"『雨が弱まってからゆっくりおいで』","trans":"“等雨小一点再慢慢过来”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020160","name":"円香","text":"……どこに行くのか、知らないけど","trans":"……虽然不知道是要去哪里","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020170","name":"円香","text":"────くるくると","trans":"────团团转地","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020190","name":"雛菜","text":"………………\r\n暇だね～","trans":"………………\n好闲啊～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020210","name":"円香","text":"暇なら暇で\r\nいいんじゃない","trans":"闲就闲呗\n不也挺好吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020220","name":"円香","text":"最近、忙しかったし","trans":"毕竟最近很忙","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020240","name":"円香","text":"あれ、どうだったっけ……","trans":"诶，之前是怎样的来着……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020250","name":"円香","text":"……や、忙しかった\r\nうん","trans":"……不，很忙\n嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020270","name":"円香","text":"走り出した、から","trans":"因为，开始跑起来了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020290","name":"雛菜","text":"……忙しかったのかもね～？\r\n学校も休んでたみたいだし","trans":"……可能是很忙吧～？\n好像学校也请假了呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020310","name":"円香","text":"だから、たまには──","trans":"所以，偶尔也──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020320","name":"雛菜","text":"でも、円香先輩は暇だったでしょ～？","trans":"可是，圆香前辈很闲吧～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020330","name":"円香","text":"────火が爆ぜる","trans":"────火苗爆开","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020340","name":"円香","text":"煙が揺れる","trans":"烟雾摇曳","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020350","name":"円香","text":"暇────","trans":"闲────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020360","name":"円香","text":"暇ではないんじゃない？\r\n普通に","trans":"也不算闲吧？\n就正常来说","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020370","name":"円香","text":"学校あるし","trans":"毕竟要上学","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020390","name":"円香","text":"混ざりながら、影絵が走る","trans":"一边混杂着，剪影奔跑起来","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020410","name":"雛菜","text":"どうしたの～？","trans":"怎么了～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020420","name":"円香","text":"やば、眠い……","trans":"糟了，好困……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020430","name":"円香","text":"ちょっと寝る","trans":"我睡一会儿","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020440","name":"雛菜","text":"ここで～？\r\n家に帰ればいいのに","trans":"在这里～？\n明明回家睡就好了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020460","name":"円香","text":"わかった……\r\n家に帰って、寝る……","trans":"知道了……\n我回家，睡觉……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020480","name":"雛菜","text":"へ～……\r\nなんで寝るの～？","trans":"诶～……\n为什么要睡啊～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020490","name":"雛菜","text":"円香先輩～？","trans":"圆香前辈～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010020510","name":"雛菜","text":"円香先輩～……","trans":"圆香前辈～……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}